E
inscription wall~
  One man in ten is very strong,
  One man in twenty is very wise.
  Together they cannot go wrong;
  Apart, they shall drop like flies.

  The wise man's chore is here,
  Should he not be consumed by fear.
  The strong man's chore is near,
  Should the other's wisdom be clear.

  Speaketh the word of the omniscient eye,
  Be not afraid of what may be,
  For if you lie, you will not die;
  Speaketh what the omniscient eye see.

~
